{"step_index":329,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-08T19:20:42Z","content":"The frontend and backend are hosted and running.\n\n---\n\n### Active Services\n\n| Component | URL | Status | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Frontend UI** | [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173) | **ONLINE (200 OK)** | NEXUS Intelligence React Dashboard |\n| **Backend API** | [http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000) | **ONLINE (200 OK)** | FastAPI server |\n| **Swagger Docs** | [http://localhost:8000/docs](http://localhost:8000/docs) | **ONLINE (200 OK)** | Interactive API documentation |\n| **Health Check** | [http://localhost:8000/health](http://localhost:8000/health) | **ONLINE (200 OK)** | Synthetic dataset status |\n\n*(Both servers are bound to `0.0.0.0`, so devices on the same Wi-Fi network can also access them via `http://<your-local-ip>:5173`).*\n\n---\n\n### Need to Keep Them Running or Share Externally?\n\n1. **One-Click Local Launcher**:\n   You can double-click `start_nexus.bat` in `C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\` anytime to launch both servers in dedicated windows.\n\n2. **Temporary Public URL (Share with Others)**:\n   If you want an instant public internet link to share with teammates without cloud deployment, run:\n   ```powershell\n   npx localtunnel --port 5173\n   ```\n\n3. **Cloud Production Deployment**:\n   - **Frontend**: Deploy `scratch/nexus` to **Vercel** or **Cloudflare Pages** (`npm run build`, output: `dist`).\n   - **Backend**: Deploy `scratch/backend` to **Render** or **Railway** (start command: `uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT`)."}
