{"step_index":335,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-08T19:32:16Z","content":"The `start_nexus` launcher is located at:\n```\nC:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\start_nexus.bat\n```\n*(A PowerShell script [start_nexus.ps1](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/start_nexus.ps1) is also available in the same directory).*\n\n---\n\n### How to Run It\n\n#### Method 1: File Explorer (One-Click)\n1. Open File Explorer to:\n   ```\n   C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\\n   ```\n2. Double-click **`start_nexus.bat`**.\n\n---\n\n#### Method 2: From Terminal (PowerShell or CMD)\n```powershell\ncd \"C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\"\n.\\start_nexus.bat\n```\n*Or using PowerShell script:*\n```powershell\n.\\start_nexus.ps1\n```\n\n---\n\n### What It Does\n1. **Starts Backend API**: Opens a dedicated console window running Uvicorn on [http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000) with hot-reloading.\n2. **Starts React Frontend**: Opens a second console window running Vite on [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173) with network binding (`0.0.0.0`).\n3. **Opens Browser**: Automatically launches your default web browser to [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173).\n4. **Keeps Logs Visible**: Both terminal windows stay open so you can monitor live incoming API requests, errors, and Vite builds in real time.\n\n---\n\n### How to Stop\nClose the two opened terminal windows or press `Ctrl + C` in each of them.","thinking":"**Explaining execution methods**\n\n`start_nexus.bat` and `start_nexus.ps1` are located in the specified directory. These scripts provide two execution methods. The first is double-clicking the .bat file in Windows File Explorer. The second is running from a PowerShell terminal, first navigating to the directory and then executing the relevant script.\n\n\n"}
